endobj
176 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 134 0 R
/T (1. Retrieval Phase When a user asks a question, the RAG system does not immediately send the prompt to the language model. Instead, it first searches a vast, curated knowledge base \(such as a database of documents, articles, or internal company data\) to find relevant context)
/E (1. Retrieval Phase When a user asks a question, the RAG system does not immediately send the prompt to the language model. Instead, it first searches a vast, curated knowledge base \(such as a database of documents, articles, or internal company data\) to find relevant context)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
