/T (Indexing and Embedding: The external knowledge base is pre-processed and indexed. Each document or chunk of text is converted into a numerical representation called a vector embedding, which captures its semantic meaning.)
/E (Indexing and Embedding: The external knowledge base is pre-processed and indexed. Each document or chunk of text is converted into a numerical representation called a vector embedding, which captures its semantic meaning.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 442 0 R
/T (Vector Search: The user's query is also converted into a vector embedding. A vector similarity search algorithm is then used to quickly find the top "k" most relevant documents in the knowledge base that are semantically similar to the query. )
/E (Vector Search: The user's query is also converted into a vector embedding. A vector similarity search algorithm is then used to quickly find the top "k" most relevant documents in the knowledge base that are semantically similar to the query. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
