778 0 obj
<<
/Title (Vector Search: The user's query is also converted into a vector embedding. A vector similarity search algorithm is then used to quickly find the top "k" most relevant documents in the knowledge base that are semantically similar to the query.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 776 0 R
/Next 780 0 R
>>
endobj
